    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d617">

                <pb facs="0755" n="667" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg667"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pearson to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Temporarily at Washington</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1904-07-08"><hi rendition="#italic">July 8,
                                1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to hand you herewith copy
                    of an identical note addressed to the Persian Government by the British minister
                    to Persia and by myself as minister of the United States.</p>
                <p>I am pleased to be able to add that the note, however unusual in its tone, has
                    had for its effect the capture and incarceration of Seyid Ghaffar, who has
                    murdered a British subject and an American citizen, both within the past six
                    months, and whose claim of lineal descent from Mahomet made his arrest difficult
                    and peculiarly embarrassing to the Persian Government.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Richmond Pearson</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">American Minister to Persia.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d617-a1.xml" xpointer="d617-a1"/>
